    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths feels rigidly structured for me—like following a precise recipe—but I’ve always found its abstract logic fascinating. My parents, both PhDs in STEM fields, instilled curiosity rather than fear, so while I’m not naturally strong in calculations, I enjoy the problem-solving mind games it presents. It’s a mix of discipline and playtime for me.",
